{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f IMPORTANT WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X-POINT IS NOT A CASUAL GAME.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no simplified tutorial</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no quick victories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no \u201cpress a button - get fun\u201d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistakes have consequences</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not ready to <strong>study</strong>, <strong>read</strong>, <strong>analyze</strong>, and <strong>learn from your own failures</strong> - <strong>please do not buy this game</strong>.<br><br>\u274c WHAT THIS GAME DOES NOT OFFER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid false expectations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c this is <strong>not</strong> a shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c this is <strong>not</strong> an arcade game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c this is <strong>not</strong> a \u201c15-minute session\u201d game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c this is <strong>not</strong> beginner-friendly software</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c this is <strong>not</strong> a relaxation product</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are used to games adapting to you - X-POINT will not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2714\ufe0f WHO THIS GAME IS FOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-POINT is created <strong>exclusively</strong> for players who enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >studying complex systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finding solutions independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making irreversible strategic decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >understanding mechanics instead of pressing buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >playing games that <strong>do not try to please everyone</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get satisfaction from <strong>the process of understanding</strong>, not instant reward \u2014 you are in the right place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea PROJECT PHILOSOPHY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-POINT does not try to be convenient.<br>Does not try to be friendly.<br>Does not try to appeal to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>deliberately niche game</strong>, created for a limited audience that values depth over accessibility.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1c0ec591f34a92260a5c8ae58670740637c728ed.jpg","localized_name":"ALPHA TEAM FIGHTER","name":"ALPHA TEAM FIGHTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018720/1c0ec591f34a92260a5c8ae58670740637c728ed.jpg"},{"icon":"ca88250b2f4f50afc79ddb1b73906c469a5bc2b7.jpg","localized_name":"MONSTER HUNT","name":"MONSTER HUNT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018720/ca88250b2f4f50afc79ddb1b73906c469a5bc2b7.jpg"},{"icon":"0ca31553987f52cb4479d8a642c3514e9c91c58c.jpg","localized_name":"VACATION TIME!","name":"VACATION TIME!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018720/0ca31553987f52cb4479d8a642c3514e9c91c58c.jpg"},{"icon":"b876d5fc60ff5081f78c9568baff564f32f2ee58.jpg","localized_name":"PARTY TIME!","name":"PARTY TIME!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018720/b876d5fc60ff5081f78c9568baff564f32f2ee58.jpg"},{"icon":"19287d3e997b14ded85d707b749aca592db765f3.jpg","localized_name":"IN ONE BREATH!","name":"IN ONE BREATH!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018720/19287d3e997b14ded85d707b749aca592db765f3.jpg"},{"icon":"e8540fc3825b1295d2aba7ffa5d885dd9e213d23.jpg","localized_name":"FEATURES OF THE NATIONAL NEW YEAR!","name":"FEATURES OF THE NATIONAL NEW YEAR!","path":"https://cd